Part B: step size (LSB) for more bits, same vref
 8 bits:    256 codes, LSB = 0.011719 V =   11.719 mV
10 bits:   1024 codes, LSB = 0.002930 V =    2.930 mV
12 bits:   4096 codes, LSB = 0.000732 V =    0.732 mV
16 bits:  65536 codes, LSB = 0.000046 V =    0.046 mV

